<a href="/ai/marketing">AI in marketing</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer__row"><h4><a href="/genres">Genres</a></h4><ul><li><a href="/genres/action">Action</a></li><li><a href="/genres/adventure">Adventure</a></li><li><a href="/genres/casual">Casual</a></li><li><a href="/genres/indie">Indie</a></li><li><a href="/genres/rpg">RPG</a></li><li><a href="/genres/simulation">Simulation</a></li><li><a href="/genres/strategy">Strategy</a></li><li><a href="/genres/sports">Sports</a></li><li><a href="/genres/racing">Racing</a></li><li><a href="/genres/massively-multiplayer">MMO</a></li><li><a href="/genres/free-to-play">Free to play</a></li></ul></div></nav><div class="footer__bottom"><div class="footer__notes"><span>Game data from public Steam store pages. GameDB.ai is not affiliated with Valve.</span><span class="footer__proto">Revenue and wishlists are GameDB estimates · AI labels are read from each game’s Steam disclosure</span><span class="footer__legal"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><button type="button" data-open-consent="">Cookie settings</button></span></div><div class="theme-switch" role="group" aria-label="Color theme"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-moon"></use></svg>Dark</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-sun"></use></svg>Light</button></div></div></div></footer><dialog class="modal" id="claim-dialog" aria-labelledby="claim-title"><div class="modal__form"><header class="modal__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">For developers</p><h2 id="claim-title">Claim your game</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-btn" aria-label="Close"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-x"></use></svg></button></header><form class="modal__stack" noValidate=""><p class="modal__lede">Steam games with an AI disclosure are added automatically, several times a day. Claim yours to confirm how it uses AI: it gets a Verified badge next to its name, and you can tell the story behind it.</p><label class="field" for="claim-url"><span>Your game on Steam</span><input id="claim-url" type="url" placeholder="https://store.steampowered.com/app/…" aria-invalid="false" name="url" value=""/></label><footer class="modal__foot"><span class="modal__note">No claim is needed to stay listed.</span><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost">Cancel</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Continue</button></footer></form></div></dialog><dialog class="modal modal--auth" id="signin-dialog" aria-labelledby="signin-title"><div class="modal__form auth"><header class="modal__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">GameDB.ai</p><h2 id="signin-title">Sign in</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-btn" aria-label="Close"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-x"></use></svg></button></header><p class="modal__lede">Keep your stars on every device, and claim the games you make.</p><a class="btn btn--lg btn--steam" href="/auth/steam"><svg class="i i--fill i--brand" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M11.979 0C5.678 0 .511 4.86.022 11.037l6.432 2.658c.545-.371 1.203-.59 1.912-.59.063 0 .125.004.188.006l2.861-4.142V8.91c0-2.495 2.028-4.524 4.524-4.524 2.494 0 4.524 2.031 4.524 4.527s-2.03 4.525-4.524 4.525h-.105l-4.076 2.911c0 .052.004.105.004.159 0 1.875-1.515 3.396-3.39 3.396-1.635 0-3.016-1.173-3.331-2.727L.436 15.27C1.862 20.307 6.486 24 11.979 24c6.627 0 11.999-5.373 11.999-12S18.605 0 11.979 0zM7.54 18.21l-1.473-.61c.262.543.714.999 1.314 1.25 1.297.539 2.793-.076 3.332-1.375.263-.63.264-1.319.005-1.949s-.75-1.121-1.377-1.383c-.624-.26-1.29-.249-1.878-.03l1.523.63c.956.4 1.409 1.5 1.009 2.455-.397.957-1.497 1.41-2.454 1.012H7.54zm11.415-9.303c0-1.662-1.353-3.015-3.015-3.015-1.665 0-3.015 1.353-3.015 3.015 