veloper says AI isn’t used here"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-live"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">In-game AI</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not used</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Code: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-code"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Code</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-used" title="Art — Partial: AI made part of it, alongside human work."><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-art"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Art</span><span class="desc-tile__scope"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Music &amp; SFX: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-audio"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Music &amp; SFX</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-used" title="Voice — Partial: AI made part of it, alongside human work."><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-voice"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Voice</span><span class="desc-tile__scope"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Writing: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-writing"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Writing</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-unknown" title="Translation: not mentioned in the disclosure"><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-translation"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Translation</span><span class="desc-tile__scope">Not stated</span></li><li class="desc-tile is-used" title="Marketing — Partial: AI made part of it, alongside human work."><span class="desc-tile__icon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-marketing"></use></svg></span><span class="desc-tile__label">Marketing</span><span class="desc-tile__scope"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></li></ul><div class="ai-details"><div class="ai-detail"><div class="ai-detail__area"><span class="ai-detail__name"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-art"></use></svg>Art</span><span class="scope-pill"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></div><div><p>Some character art, animation frames, UI and item icons were created or refined with generative AI tools.</p></div></div><div class="ai-detail"><div class="ai-detail__area"><span class="ai-detail__name"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-voice"></use></svg>Voice</span><span class="scope-pill"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></div><div><p>Some character voice lines were created or refined with generative AI tools.</p></div></div><div class="ai-detail"><div class="ai-detail__area"><span class="ai-detail__name"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-marketing"></use></svg>Marketing</span><span class="scope-pill"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></div><div><p>Some store and promotional artwork was created or refined with generative AI tools.</p></div></div></div><dl class="ai-facts"><div><dt>Not used, per the developer</dt><dd><span class="muted-list"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-live"></use></svg>In-game AI</span></span></dd></div><div><dt>Not mentioned</dt><dd><span class="muted-list"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-code"></use></svg>Code</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-audio"></use></svg>Music &amp; SFX</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-writing"></use></svg>Writing</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-translation"></use></svg>Translation</span></span></dd></div></dl><details class="disclosure"><summary><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-chevron"></use></svg>Read the full disclosure<small>Quoted from the Steam store page</small></summary><blockquote><p>Some in-game character art, animation frames, UI and item icons, character voice lines, and store/promotional artwork were created or refined with generative AI tools. The development team selected, edited, reviewed, and curated the final AI-assisted assets. All AI content is pre-generated; no generative AI runs during gameplay.</p></blockquote></details><div class="ai-label__foot"><div class="scope-legend"><span><span class="meter meter--core" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Core</span><span><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span><span><span class="meter meter--assist" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Assist</span><span><span class="meter meter--prototype" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Placeholder</span></div><button type="button" class="link-quiet" data-proto="Corrections open a short form — coming soon"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-flag"></use></svg>Suggest a correction</button></div></article></section></div><script>$RS("S:7","P:7")</script><div hidden id="S:8"><section class="g-section" id="growth" aria-labelledby="growth-title"><div class="g-section__head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Players · followers</p><h2 id="growth-title">Growth</h2></div></div><div class="chart-card"><div class="chart-card__head"><div><h3 class="chart-card__title">Players online</h3><p class="chart-card__sub">Last 7 days, hourly · now 29 · 24h peak 33</p></div><div class="chart-card__tools"><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-table"></use></svg>Table</button></div></div><div class="chart" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Players online, last 7 days, hourly: 40 at Oct 30, 13:00 UTC, 29 now. Use the arrow keys to read hourly values."><svg viewBox="0 0 640 290" width="640" height="290" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g class="grid"><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="260.0" y2="260.0" class="base"></line><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="179.3" y2="179.3"></line><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="98.7" y2="98.7"></line><line x1="52" x2="578" y1="18.0" y2="18.0"></line></g><g class="axis"><text x="42" y="263.5" text-anchor="end">0</text><text x="42" y="182.8" text-anchor="end">20</text><text x="42" y="102.2" text-anchor="end">40</text><text x="42" y="21.5" text-anchor="end">60</text><text x="87.2" y="282" text-anchor="middle">Oct 31</text><text x="163.9" y="282" text-anchor="middle">Nov 1</text><text x="240.7" y="282" text-anchor="middle">Nov 2</text><text x="317.4" y="282" text-anchor="middle">Nov 3</text><text x="394.1" y="282" text-anchor="middle">Nov 4</text><text x="470.9" 